Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm exactly hero material.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor! Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:00:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take a step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll take a step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's not a dream, it's not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a dream, but I'll never get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a step forward, and\NI'll give you the strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all right. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it all makes so much sense to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Rolo, for all your help. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon calmed down\Njust like you told it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.31,0:02:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really saved my butt. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't. It wasn't me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It totally just stopped\Nattacking all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know it was because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That definitely wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.47,0:02:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are people out there scared of my\Npower and really hate that I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:02:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon is docile now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it knew Rolo could control it\Nno matter how ferocious it got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was intimidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I getcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.73,0:03:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.53,0:03:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since that's done, can I\Nmaybe ask you for a favor? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this might sound a little odd,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but could you send this dragon\Nback to where it came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Logic tells us that we should probably\Njust kill the thing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.49,0:03:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, even I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we could, I really\Ndon't want to kill this fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's kind of\Nselfish of me to say that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but could you maybe\Njust cut it some slack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay ah if that's what you really want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:03:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo, can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, given how powerful it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best I can do is just ask nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of them are afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Rolo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said it would do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its master orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dragon really said that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this hardly seems real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy to think such a massive\Ncreature would call Rolo its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then... Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the big guy to pack up and quietly\Ngo back to wherever it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, also, while we're at it, tell it not\Nto mess with any more humans, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to agree to\Neverything you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it couldn't have worked out\Nany more in our favor than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a dragon that has\Nlived for thousands of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years Riz is still a\Nstupid beast in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more than my pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought nothing would\Nbe left of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commence attack. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are certain this will\Nbring an end to Clay's kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I am not backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A well-known beast tamer\Nhas already awakened
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Dragon of Calamity\Nand brought it to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it was worth the\Nexorbitant price they demanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.53,0:08:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, after the dragon goes\Non a rampage, our forces will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All foot soldiers will be equipped\Nwith magic swords and magic shields,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while the elite troops will have\Nmagic armor and magic cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have three Aegises,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the mobile mana bulwark generation device,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and four of the ultra-high output mana\Nray weapons, the devastating Brionacal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.97,0:08:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you to say, Rondaeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon my bluntness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just do not see how this war can\Npossibly benefit our country in the long run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can threaten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stand at the forefront of\Ntechnology and magical prominence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will make sure\Nthe whole world knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the near future, people will tell\Nbut one tale of the Klai's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a country of fools who neglected\Nproper upkeep of the Dungeon of the Lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,led down a path to ruin by\Ntheir own selfish greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we shall be remembered as\Nthe humanitarian force that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,liberated the people from\Ntheir imbecile of a monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,History has no need for\Nmultiple storytellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One truth is all the people can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See? It's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.69,0:09:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Magical Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the princess, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next to her is Ines, the Divine Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the living legends\Nknown all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she is the reason\Nwhy the royal capital
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has not been completely\Nrazed to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the era where legends\Nrule has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now live in an era that is\Ndefined by those with wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire the Brionac at them immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may be the divine shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the heat of the Brionac\Nwill evaporate her into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet another one of their so-called\Nlegends will die horrifically by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what beautiful bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I simply adore war.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Brionac is prepared to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is prepared, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:12:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, please, stand back. Rolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must have been a misfire due to a\Nproblem with the mana condensation process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You half-wits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare the next one immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And oh my gosh, look at all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said that was the Imperial Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Dorytus III\Nhas mobilized his troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he has an\Nendless supply of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can say is Dorytus\Nhas brought this force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the purpose of\Ndestroying our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have our army at the Capitol,\Nbut not enough for those numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, we should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are of no use here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back and meet up with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the situation, do you need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really no choice but\Nto get our butts out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.99,0:13:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was silly of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think she'd be more terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obviously we should...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack's incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is aggravating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to take cover in the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish the job quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna keep us\Npinned here like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess there's only really one way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get all their\Nattention focused on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use that as a chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not great at fighting,\Nbut running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, I'm kind of an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to go hunting for honeycomb all the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time and was always\Ngetting attacked by bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I just run around like\Ncrazy, things will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I plan on coming back\Nalive, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least allow me to offer you the\None thing I can do to help, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be some defense magic. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Impact? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised to control the output\Nthis time, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean going on some kind of\Ncrazy suicide mission. Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another one of those lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next one's on its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving everything in your\Nhands, Instructor! Go forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Godspeed! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready for the impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancement!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know I can deflect those.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My momentum is too strong to change\Ncourse, so here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it as far as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more time I can buy, the\Nbetter chance they have to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to run around and\Nparry every single thing I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our weapons are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd my weapon go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defend yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.41,0:17:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those up in the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the devil just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.77,0:18:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.31,0:18:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.\NWere you not? This just
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't make sense he was way over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:19:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he cover all that distance he
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is looking at me he pays no mind to the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial gods, just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must know I am the Emperor, in\Nwhich case I must be his target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is going to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, I have my Kaiser armor and\NKaiser sword, both made of or a calcium.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.69,0:19:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are our cannons\Nsticking out of the ground like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.05,0:20:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in God's name is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had 10,000 soldiers that\Nwere all perfectly equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And aeguses that could defend\Nagainst dragon's breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the Brionac can\Nburn dragons to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are they now all\Nbroken down and worthless?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you must tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why haven't you killed me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Clay's Black Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one dungeon relic I\Ncovet above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this man have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that sword is made\Nfrom an unknown metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is supposed to be too heavy\Nfor any normal human to carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.93,0:21:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have heard even that freakishly strong\Nking needed both hands to wield it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way anyone\Ncould surpass King Klai's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the only way to\Nexplain what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man has done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god, he did all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I am still\Nalive is because he wants me to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,endure the torture of humiliation\Nbefore finishing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is going to do to me exactly what\NI was planning to do to King Clays.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.09,0:21:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uha-ha-haa-ha
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.47,0:22:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-ha-haa-haa-haa-ha?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.48,0:22:09.44,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#9 I Parry an Army
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.31,0:23:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.17,0:23:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.37,0:23:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.57,0:23:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.55,0:23:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.

